# src/apps/android/app/src/androidTest/java/com

## Purpose
Maintains the top-level Java/Kotlin namespace segment for Android instrumentation tests.

## Contents
Contains the `luminet` namespace and its nested test packages.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Participates only in source/package layout; Gradle and the compiler resolve classes below this namespace during instrumentation-test builds.

## Invariants
The directory hierarchy must stay aligned with package declarations, remain test-only, and must not become an alternate production implementation root.